/*/{Protheus.doc} getNonconformityClassDescriptionSmartX
Reproduz a resolucao de descricao multi-idioma de A040DCla (QEE_DESCPO/
QEE_DESCES/QEE_DESCIN conforme __LANGUAGE), sem depender das variaveis
globais Inclui/M-> do legado -- uso exclusivo do fluxo SmartX. A040DCla
permanece inalterada no fonte legado para outros usos (QIEA010/020/215,
dicionario).
@type function
@author willian.ramalho
@since 18/08/2026
@param cClasse, character, Codigo da classe (QEE_CODIGO)
@return character, Descricao da classe no idioma do ambiente
/*/
Function getNonconformityClassDescriptionSmartX(cClasse)

    Local aArea  := QEE->(GetArea())  as array
    Local cDesc  := ""                as character
    Local nOrder := QEE->(IndexOrd()) as numeric

    QEE->(dbSetOrder(1))
    If QEE->(dbSeek(xFilial("QEE") + cClasse))
        If __LANGUAGE == "SPANISH"
            cDesc := QEE->QEE_DESCES
        ElseIf __LANGUAGE == "ENGLISH"
            cDesc := QEE->QEE_DESCIN
        Else
            cDesc := QEE->QEE_DESCPO
        EndIf
    EndIf
    QEE->(dbSetOrder(nOrder))
    RestArea(aArea)

return cDesc
